- src/tmp/make_0100_fatigue_csv.py: full pipeline from 상수관로/급수관로
  shapefiles + 0100 pressure data to fatigue_merged_zone_fixed CSV
  * reads DBF manually to handle Korean column names in 급수관로 shapefile
  * maps PIP_LBL "/" format (DCIP→DTC, HI-3P→PE, SP→ST, CIP→CI)
  * assigns zone=0100 to all pipes (single pressure sensor region)
  * outputs results/tmp/0100_fatigue_merged_zone_fixed.csv

- src/repair_loader_k.py: add strict=False mode that returns empty
  DataFrames instead of raising FileNotFoundError when K_repair files
  are missing (K_repair=0 → no effect on K_total)

- src/rainflow_processing.py:
  * auto-detect sampling rate instead of hardcoded 1/300 (5-min)
  * auto-detect date range from actual data when no dates are specified
    (uses last 1 year of available data, not hardcoded 2023)

- src/pipe_data.py: filter parse_dates to existing columns only to
  avoid pd.read_csv failure when date columns are absent in CSV

- pyproject.toml: add scipy, scikit-learn, seaborn, statsmodels to
  project dependencies so uv run installs them

- results/tmp/: 0100 intermediate + final fatigue CSVs (1641 pipes)

